   The last line is the tally JSON: `aWins`, `bWins`, `draws`, `aborted`, `edge`, `edgeLow`, `edgeHigh`, `decided`, `wonBoth`, `lostBoth`, `diverged`, and `inconclusive` when it applies. A count of 400 means every game was clean. Copy both lines into `.bot-notes.md` straight away, because the log does not survive a cut.

